4. Generate a drop-in module that runs the original and the Mojo port side by side

Usage: mojo-anything shadow [OPTIONS] [CRATE_DIR]

Arguments:
  [CRATE_DIR]  [default: .]

Options:
  -o, --out <OUT>  Where to write the module; defaults to `<crate>/shadow/<name>.shadow.ts`
  -h, --help       Print help
